{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "17aabbfd31dd14e705a0291cbe67a6b91ce4d08d8e091150de295ca547966f3e", "ja": "好きなものを、好きなだけ", "zh": "想吃多少喜欢的，就吃多少", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e80ea7d46d5aabddb79631fdeac70c4a8321ec423acc3a919f6ff28b418e72b1", "ja": "公演を無事に終えてスイーツビュッフェでの\n打ち上げ。公演前の凛とした姿とは異なる、\nスイーツにはしゃぐ3人の様子を見守りつつ\nプロデューサーは今後もアイドル達の真の\n魅力を見つけていこうと奮起するのだった。", "zh": "公演顺利结束后，大家在甜点自助餐厅举行庆功宴。制作人一边看着与公演前凛然的模样不同、因甜点而兴奋不已的3人，一边下定决心今后也要继续发掘偶像们真正的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1000_401pro", "source_sha256": "1a0dddb023fc153ae9208e416dd8c0df25d6d27f512672983adc243ed6f4b12b", "ja": "コホン。えー、美也、朋花、まつり！\n新曲公演、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "咳咳。呃——美也、朋花、茉莉！\n新歌公演，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "b10b2b88d1f81d40e03b56d1a86c4793ac231b9e132676c06ccd5eb6dd116951", "ja": "学祭ライブから立て続けのステージだったけど、\n大反響のうちに千秋楽を迎えられた。", "zh": "虽然刚结束学园祭演出就马不停蹄地登台，\n但还是在热烈的反响中迎来了终场演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "2c28efffb0c7bc71fbb381da8c9629b5c111d79976ef2db4c77b326a777eb9a7", "ja": "これもひとえに、3人の頑張りに他ならない。", "zh": "这一切都离不开3人的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "c5cb2ad5ce7c925b972aa060e94e5d6388b6530ab74e0e92d48e1d2cfce8d879", "ja": "その労をねぎらう意味で、\nこうして打ち上げを開催して……。", "zh": "为了慰劳你们的辛劳，才特意举办了这场庆功宴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "2e34aa15d3d06326149efc648df2a67bc2a5ecceac5ab6bbee2a3168344ace2f", "ja": "プロデューサーさん～？　もしかして\nそのお話は長くなりそうですか～？", "zh": "制作人～？难道说，您这番话会讲很久吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "32367e59ec488a9817f57f91692a9e28861fbcff0130e6abd8377bb38df49e44", "ja": "えっ。いや、一応プロデューサーとして\n最初の挨拶を軽く、と思っただけなんだけど……？", "zh": "咦。不是，我只是想以制作人的身份简单打个招呼而已……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "3b1cff39cf0fe2d60ebe31d1283561456946409c591efad2e7394974d4aa5be6", "ja": "スイーツビュッフェには合わないと思います～。\nそういうのは他所でやってくださいね～？", "zh": "我觉得这不适合甜点自助餐～。\n这种事请到别处去做吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e819103bdeabc36f899fb5621341ef25b49bd9873e85efa0623e948b5eab58b3", "ja": "おや？　季節限定のマシュマロタルトに、\nものすごい勢いで人が集まっていきますな～。", "zh": "哦呀？　人们正以惊人的势头聚集到季节限定的棉花糖挞那里去了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "33cb36e6f4fd046829ae298c41f60c2a4134fc137172b4ad387fca9985f0b232", "ja": "ほ？　それは一大事なのです！　マシュマロ好きと\nして、じっとしてる場合じゃないのです！", "zh": "哦？那可是大事啊！作为棉花糖爱好者，现在可不是袖手旁观的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "2617399fd249abfd62db3b31bdb605a1d17416d374f8e8b3d207cb3e9bc66277", "ja": "そ、そうか……わかった、よくわかった。とにかく\n今日は、好きな物を好きなだけ食べてくれ！", "zh": "这、这样啊……知道了，我非常清楚了。总之，今天想吃什么就吃个够吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "912277b74159fa6a6ac8524b63aa868beb4d3fe5f0f282dfd5c5a835c2134d17", "ja": "ここは和菓子コーナーもあるんですね～。\n見た目も涼やかな葛切りにしました～。", "zh": "这里还有和果子专区呢～  \n我选了看起来也很清凉的葛切～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "25f75f0a1612112a8c24709546c8ab19fba3b842a88416e16db13c8971466b91", "ja": "私はサンドイッチです～。\n一口サイズで、とってもかわいいんですよ～♪", "zh": "我是三明治～。\n是一口大小的，特别可爱哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "775b7760cb597b896b980c311e78e91b2097b81eeca08433d4000439bf285db0", "ja": "マシュマロタルト、あと一歩届かなかったのです。\nしょんぼりなのです。しおしおなのです……。", "zh": "棉花糖挞还差一点就够到了。  \n好沮丧哦。整个人都蔫蔫的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "77738d368752e35f22f538461f5d44f7bbf45bc5d5bf36218d6cb3c9067467eb", "ja": "え、そうだったのか……。まつりはプロフィールに\n書くくらい、マシュマロが大好きなのになぁ……。", "zh": "诶，原来是这样啊……。明明小祭喜欢棉花糖到都写进个人资料里了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "fa378c5a86cfa08a42de842e299348f7f494be6aee18a88062c083bd13fdeb7d", "ja": "あら、まつりさん、そうだったんですか～？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊，茉莉小姐～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "8e484f62af4d4dd7f081a0989f39d710db746f78894c8ac1b35dfe9b71e480a9", "ja": "朋花ちゃん、余計なこと言わなくていいのですよ？", "zh": "朋花，你不用说多余的话哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "ab0ee43001042545932c8be7bc91d7359efc7b82dbc57f88e0ad0be43e49547c", "ja": "それじゃ俺が確保できたのをあげるよ。\nまつり、遠慮なく食べてくれ。どうぞ！", "zh": "那我就把我设法弄到的给你吧。\n茉莉，不用客气，尽管吃。给！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "983932d921e1d2bf2b244168d0993da8a1bee15da536511016b8e235c21b7b39", "ja": "ほっ！？　そ、それは……、大丈夫なのです！\n姫は人の施しマシュマロは受けないのです！", "zh": "啊！？这、这就不用了……没关系的！\n公主才不会接受别人施舍的棉花糖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "4f7fdb98c997ec44fd02be471c7e88e15e2f6f967852f3d66c1f0f0870c3d993", "ja": "施しマシュマロ……？", "zh": "施舍棉花糖……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "924a131ffb40d8f411bf2b315dd44c20b2096ef3f271a7046051406d87bd7ac2", "ja": "姫にはその限定マシュマロタルトさんの\n声が聞こえるのです！", "zh": "公主能听到那个限定棉花糖挞的心声哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "613fe26910501bd527d830ac8da3915126c831da49e077ec5c7bf56092d8bf42", "ja": "選んだ人に食べてもらうことこそが、\n一番の幸せ……。そう言っているのです！", "zh": "能让选中它的人吃掉，才是最大的幸福……它是这么说的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "26b4ee7374ea3f185bfc6b874300f316a4ec13889f7ec45de53ee6e89e975d4c", "ja": "い、いいのかな……？\nまつりがいいなら、いいんだけど……。", "zh": "真、真的可以吗……？\n既然茉莉觉得没问题，那倒是无所谓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "7a59b4f179736b5b2b9777017a72bb33d9ba01b3f0149f8e1a90829eea83275d", "ja": "まつりちゃん、2回戦といきませんか～？\n私のオススメを紹介しますよ～。", "zh": "茉莉，要不要来第2回合～？\n我来介绍一下我的推荐吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "6fab86d87bf5aa2721f14c7af2b3bd6d7a7fc5df66d95220893b0144b5f71f9c", "ja": "甘いもの以外では、\n塩気の系統も気になりますね～。", "zh": "除了甜食以外，我也很想了解咸味的种类呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "1372e2a52fcd4c0abc71331b584eb9d03753da1e98b1dd4b19084e1d5b88ac21", "ja": "皆さん、お互いに情報を交換し合って、\nこちらのベストセレクション皿を目指しましょう♪", "zh": "大家互相交换信息，一起朝着这份最佳精选拼盘努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "3988f906365d6ea6275b32c7313c6ae87dff8412a0f0ff9ceb3601582f529f10", "ja": "（……。こうして見ていると、あんなにすごい\nライブをやってのけた子達に見えないけどな）", "zh": "（……这样看着，真看不出她们就是办成了那么精彩演唱会的孩子们啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "50645006c6f0fa79a371fc9e84de8838f38507f8eaac2af29ed9d123aed1ab8e", "ja": "（わかったつもりでいたけど、アイドルの魅力には、\nまだまだ気付かされることが多い……）", "zh": "（我本以为自己已经理解了，但偶像的魅力还有很多地方让我不断有所察觉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_06_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "c26a3e40f7abb591b7eb234e5ace2cf36c877eaeedb55c4a09c65be10a914fc2", "ja": "（それは、この3人にも限らない。劇場のアイドル\nみんなの魅力を、これからも見つけていこう！）", "zh": "（不只是这3个人。今后也要继续发掘剧场里所有偶像的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
